  "title": "Creamy Shrimp Bisque",
  "description": "This creamy shrimp bisque recipe simmers shrimp shells and spices in a thick seafood stock, seasoned with paprika, tomato paste, cream, and sherry.",
  "authors": [
    "AFGLEZ"
  ],
